Great] reminders that[ "said]" and "[ask]ed" are invisible to the[ reader]. The only other one I like to[ use (sp]aringly) is[ "]whispered."
[Good] post. I don't like[ ad]verb tags, either. The content of your writing should tell you if your are[ acting mis]chievously or skeptically[. You] see these[ tags] a lot in older books.[
